---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Eldritch, Inc. builds software for complex AI systems. Founded by engineer and architect Eris Discordia Montano."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="site-container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Eldritch</p>

      <h1>
        We build software
        for complex systems.
      </h1>

      <p class="lede">
        Eldritch, Inc. is a software company focused on the engineering
        problems that emerge as artificial intelligence becomes part of
        larger, increasingly complex software systems.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company">
    <div class="site-container company-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The company</p>

        <h2>
          Engineering the systems
          around intelligence.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="company-copy">
        <p>
          Eldritch was founded to build ambitious software at the
          intersection of distributed systems, automation, developer
          infrastructure, and artificial intelligence.
        </p>

        <p>
          Today, our primary focus is Azathoth: an open-source framework
          for constructing, evaluating, and optimizing AI workflows.
        </p>

        <p class="emphasis">
          We believe increasingly capable AI systems require the same
          engineering discipline expected from every other important
          software system: explicit architecture, repeatable evaluation,
          measurable behavior, and evidence-driven optimization.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="founder">
    <div class="site-container founder-grid">
      <div class="portrait">
        <img
          src="/images/eris-discordia-montano.jpeg"
          alt="Eris Discordia Montano, Founder and Principal Engineer of Eldritch, Inc."
        />
      </div>

      <div class="founder-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Founder</p>

        <h2>Eris Discordia Montano</h2>

        <p class="role">Founder & Principal Engineer</p>

        <p>
          Eris is a software engineer, architect, and engineering leader
          with nearly three decades of experience building and modernizing
          complex technical systems.
        </p>

        <p>
          Her career has moved through scientific research, commercial
          online gaming, enterprise infrastructure, distributed systems,
          cloud engineering, organizational transformation, and artificial
          intelligence.
        </p>

        <p>
          She has architected systems across healthcare, biotechnology,
          telecommunications, logistics, agriculture, enterprise SaaS,
          gaming, and AI, while mentoring engineers and leading technical
          organizations through major shifts in how software is built.
        </p>

        <div class="founder-links">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/EldritchInc"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="mailto:eris@eldritchinc.com"
          >
            Email
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="history">
    <div class="site-container">
      <div class="history-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected history</p>

        <h2>
          Three decades of
          technological change.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline">
        <article>
          <p class="period">Today</p>

          <div>
            <h3>Artificial intelligence</h3>
            <p>
              Building AI infrastructure, autonomous workflow systems,
              evaluation frameworks, and Azathoth at Eldritch.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article>
          <p class="period">Cloud era</p>

          <div>
            <h3>Distributed systems & engineering transformation</h3>
            <p>
              Architected cloud platforms, event-driven systems, enterprise
              infrastructure, and modernization initiatives while coaching
              engineering organizations through major technical transitions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article>
          <p class="period">Internet era</p>

          <div>
            <h3>Networked applications & multiplayer systems</h3>
            <p>
              Built enterprise web applications, telecommunications
              platforms, RFID systems, real-time audience technologies,
              and commercial multiplayer gaming infrastructure.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article>
          <p class="period">Origins</p>

          <div>
            <h3>Science & computation</h3>
            <p>
              Began in medical device research, molecular biology, and plant
              genetic engineering before moving fully into software.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="leadership">
    <div class="site-container leadership-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Engineering leadership</p>

        <h2>
          Build systems.
          Build engineers.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="leadership-copy">
        <p>
          Engineering is not only architecture and code. It is also the
          ability to create environments in which other engineers become
          better.
        </p>

        <p>
          Eris founded QDivision, an internal engineering accelerator that
          graduated 23 engineers across three cohorts into production Agile
          teams. Every graduate advanced to a senior engineering role within
          approximately one year.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing">
    <div class="site-container closing-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What comes next</p>

        <h2>
          The next transition
          is already underway.
        </h2>

        <p>
          Eldritch exists to help engineer it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/azathoth">
          Explore Azathoth
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <a
          class="button button-secondary"
          href="mailto:eris@eldritchinc.com"
        >
          Contact Eris
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(6rem, 13vw, 12rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .eyebrow-light {
    color: #9dbbac;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    line-height: 0.93;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .company,
  .history,
  .closing {
    padding-block: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 11rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .company-grid,
  .leadership-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 9rem);
  }

  .company h2,
  .history h2,
  .leadership h2,
  .closing h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .company-copy,
  .leadership-copy {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .company-copy p,
  .leadership-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .company-copy .emphasis {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .founder {
    padding-block: clamp(7rem, 14vw, 13rem);
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 10rem);
  }

  .portrait {
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #202420;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  }

  .portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .founder-copy h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 0.95;
  }

  .role {
    margin: 1rem 0 3rem;
    color: #9dbbac;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .founder-copy > p:not(.eyebrow):not(.role) {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: #b8bdb9;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .founder-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .founder-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-surface);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .founder-links a:hover,
  .founder-links a:focus-visible {
    color: #9dbbac;
  }

  .history-heading {
    max-width: 750px;
  }

  .timeline {
    margin-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .timeline article {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(130px, 0.35fr) minmax(0, 1.65fr);
    gap: 3rem;
    padding-block: 2.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .period {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .timeline h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .timeline article div p {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .leadership {
    padding-block: clamp(7rem, 14vw, 13rem);
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .leadership-copy p {
    color: #d0ded6;
  }

  .closing {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .closing-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .closing h2 {
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .closing-inner > div:first-child > p:last-child {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    min-height: 3.25rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-foreground);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background-color 150ms ease,
      color 150ms ease,
      border-color 150ms ease;
  }

  .button-primary {
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .button-primary:hover,
  .button-primary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .button-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .button-secondary:hover,
  .button-secondary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .company-grid,
    .founder-grid,
    .leadership-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .portrait {
      max-width: 520px;
    }

    .closing-inner {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 16vw, 5rem);
    }

    .timeline article {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .actions {
      align-items: stretch;
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .button {
      justify-content: space-between;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>